  "references": [
    {
      "name": "t3-code",
      "notes": "Main inspiration (user's own words: inspirations are apps like T3 Code, Codex and Claude Code). Screens: new thread, usage limits, settings. The Chatbot is more than a chat app (chat, todos, notes, artifacts, cash flow, monthly bills), so take the base from these apps: their beauty, how easy the screens are to read, and how coherent they are with each other, not just the chat idea. Must work in both dark and light mode."
    },
    {
      "name": "codex",
      "notes": "Main inspiration (Codex desktop app). Screens: a conversation and an images gallery. The Chatbot is more than a chat app (chat, todos, notes, artifacts, cash flow, monthly bills), so take the base from these apps: their beauty, how easy the screens are to read, and how coherent they are with each other, not just the chat idea. Must work in both dark and light mode."
    },
    {
      "name": "claude-code",
      "notes": "Main inspiration (Claude Code desktop app): a conversation with a side panel. The Chatbot is more than a chat app (chat, todos, notes, artifacts, cash flow, monthly bills), so take the base from these apps: their beauty, how easy the screens are to read, and how coherent they are with each other, not just the chat idea. Must work in both dark and light mode."
    },
    {
      "name": "linear",
      "notes": "User: 'Linear is a good reference too.' Screen: an issue with an agent panel. The Chatbot is more than a chat app (chat, todos, notes, artifacts, cash flow, monthly bills), so take the base from these apps: their beauty, how easy the screens are to read, and how coherent they are with each other, not just the chat idea. Must work in both dark and light mode."
    }
  ],
